<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10"><Font bold="true">Exercise 6.</Font>  The textbook describes how a Bayesian filter can be improved by considering pairs of words.  Implement a Bayesian spam filter that uses this idea.  Using the Shakespearean and Elizabethan sonnets as messages, compare the performance of your filter with <Font executable="false" style="Maple Input">PShakespeare</Font>.</Text-field>
</Input>
